sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLK as "Reloj (poll cada 500 ms)"
    participant RLY as OutboxRelayWorker
    participant OREP as OutboxSqlRepository
    participant PUB as RabbitMqPublisher
    participant MQ as Broker RabbitMQ
    participant CNS as EventConsumerWorker
    participant DSP as EventDispatcher
    participant IDEM as IdempotencyGuard
    participant AUD as AuditEventHandler
    participant AW as AuditSqlWriter
    participant NOT as NotificationEventHandler
    participant SMTP as Servicio de Correo

    CLK->>RLY: ExecuteAsync (tick)
    RLY->>OREP: ReclamarLoteAsync(max=100, lease=30 s)
    note over OREP: UPDATE ... WITH (ROWLOCK, READPAST)<br/>marca lease_hasta y evita que dos workers tomen el mismo lote
    OREP-->>RLY: OutboxBatch (mensajes no publicados)

    loop por cada OutboxMessage del lote
        RLY->>PUB: PublicarAsync(mensaje, ct)
        PUB->>MQ: basic.publish (exchange, routing_key, persistent)
        MQ-->>PUB: publisher confirm (ack)
        PUB-->>RLY: true
        RLY->>OREP: MarcarPublicadoAsync(outbox_id)
    end

    MQ->>CNS: entrega evento (competing consumers, prefetch=10)
    CNS->>DSP: DespacharAsync(evento, ct)
    DSP->>IDEM: TryBeginAsync(event_id)
    IDEM-->>DSP: true (primera vez)
    DSP->>DSP: ResolverHandler(tipo_evento)

    par Auditoria (obligatoria - RF-05)
        DSP->>AUD: ManejarAsync(evento)
        AUD->>AW: EscribirAsync(AuditEntry con hash encadenado)
        AW-->>AUD: ok (insert-only)
    and Notificacion al cliente
        DSP->>NOT: ManejarAsync(evento)
        NOT->>SMTP: EnviarAsync(comprobante XML/PDF + estado)
        SMTP-->>NOT: 250 OK
    end

    DSP->>IDEM: CompletarAsync(event_id, resultado)
    DSP-->>CNS: DispatchResult(Ok)
    CNS->>MQ: basic.ack
